  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Alcohol Policy Implementation in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to reduce alcohol consumption and alcohol related harms in Zambia. The project will advocate for implementation of the NAP nationally and regionally and ensure a public demand for implementation from civil society. The project will also work with traditional structures through chiefs to ensure implementation of the policy. The project aims to reduce harmful effects of alcohol consumption like SGBV, HIV/AIDS, non-communicable diseases and poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
